# Four-Valued And Bilattice Structure

Status: foundation, recovery, and frontier witness.

Modules: `ResiduatedLatticeStandalone`, `TwistProductResiduation`, `D4Gauge`,
`KleinFourGauge`, `QuartetRecurrence`, `BigradedDiamond`,
`BigradedDiamondTower`, `ValuationFiberAlgebra`,
`ValuationQuartetDischarge`, `NucleusAndCommutingNuclei`,
`NuclearAutopoiesisCell`, `PairwiseStoneClopen`,
`ModalKripkeFourValued`.

This family explains why FOUR keeps returning. The recurring four is not a
decorative motif. It is the stable shape made visible by charges, truth and
knowledge orders, nuclei, gauges, recurrence, and modal readings.

`TwistProductResiduation` and `ResiduatedLatticeStandalone` recover a
residuated-lattice presentation of the four-valued carrier. `D4Gauge` and
`KleinFourGauge` expose symmetry. `BigradedDiamond` and
`BigradedDiamondTower` organize the two axes. `ValuationFiberAlgebra` and
`ValuationQuartetDischarge` move the structure into valuation fibers.

`NucleusAndCommutingNuclei` and `NuclearAutopoiesisCell` record the nuclear
reading of the quartet. `PairwiseStoneClopen` and `ModalKripkeFourValued`
connect the same structure to recovered topological and modal presentations.

Reader warning: do not collapse the four corners into Boolean truth values. The
point is the interaction of independent evidence axes, not a fancier spelling of
true and false.
